Description: BOSS-Sentinel — unified auto-heal and performance optimizer
 C++ GTK4 monitor that detects CPU/memory/disk pressure, prompts for
 auto-heal, runs healing plus performance optimization, logs every
 action, and shows what was optimized. Bundles gtkmm runtime libraries
 for DebVerify-constrained BOSS Linux installs.

